Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.29,0:00:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.71,0:00:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should we have to share\Nthese healing crystals with you?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.12,0:00:08.55,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(850,950)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(961.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H000607&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H40\3c&H091E1C&}February {\fscx110}23{\fscx95}rd, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}   {\fscx110}35{\fscx95}th Floor • Forest of Wandering
