Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.13,0:00:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your pet lizard has\Nhealing powers, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.45,0:00:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you never fight on the front\Nline, so who are you to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.61,0:00:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to use any crystals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.03,0:00:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.05,0:00:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the popular one\Naround here, Silica.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.57,0:00:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't expect the boys\Nto help me when I need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.31,0:00:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.43,0:00:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.53,0:00:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.05,0:00:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want my items?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.11,0:00:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.02,0:00:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm never going to\Nteam up with you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.61,0:00:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know there's a ton of other parties out\Nthere who'd love to have me on their side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.81,0:00:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.75,0:00:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silica!
