Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.39,0:03:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me all alone here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.21,0:03:49.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pina!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.29,0:03:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that feather?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.11,0:03:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Pina.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.02,0:03:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.33,0:04:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're one of those\Nbeast tamers, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.07,0:04:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.01,0:04:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I got here sooner, I\Ncould have saved your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.15,0:04:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.06,0:04:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.33,0:04:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was stupid to think I could make\Nit through the forest on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.79,0:04:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.79,0:04:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did what you could. That feather.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.97,0:04:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check and see if it has an\Nitem name attached to it.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.93,0:04:31.02,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.01\frx350\blur1.2\fs37.5\c&HF0E6E5&\pos(912,299.25)}Pina's Soul
Dialogue: 2,0:04:28.93,0:04:31.02,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.01\frx350\blur1.2\fs37.5\c&HAEA6A5&\pos(912,297)}Pina's Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.27,0:04:35.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.61,0:04:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means Pina's heart's still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.57,0:04:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a chance you can revive it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.79,0:04:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, really? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.15,0:04:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the south side of floor 47, There's a\Nfield dungeon called the Hill of Memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.09,0:04:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard somewhere that the flower\Ngrowing at the top can revive familiars.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.05,0:04:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,4.47, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.77,0:05:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd offer to go get it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.63,0:05:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you'd have to do is pay for the trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.85,0:05:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is, the flower won't bloom\Nunless the familiars' master's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.97,0:05:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for telling me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.79,0:05:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I work hard to raise my\Nlevel, then someday I could...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.69,0:05:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, but the time limit's\Nthree days to revive it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.65,0:05:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.21,0:05:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.43,0:05:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Pina.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.03,0:05:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.09,0:05:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.59,0:05:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this equipment.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.82,0:05:35.25,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\fs37.5\2a&HFF&\k5\pos(786,442.5)\c&HECE7E9&}Eb{\k5}on {\k4}Dag{\k5}ger
Dialogue: 2,0:05:29.82,0:05:35.25,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\fs37.5\2a&HFF&\k5\pos(786,441)\c&H535152&}Eb{\k5}on {\k4}Dag{\k5}ger
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.03,0:05:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should boost you five or six levels.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.58,0:05:35.25,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\fs37.5\2a&HFF&\k5\pos(786,514.5)\c&HECE7E9&}Silver {\k4}Thread {\k5}Ar{\k5}mor
Dialogue: 2,0:05:30.58,0:05:35.25,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\fs37.5\2a&HFF&\k5\pos(786,513)\c&H535152&}Silver {\k4}Thread {\k5}Ar{\k5}mor
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.93,0:05:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I tag along, I'm sure\Neverything will work out.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.16,0:05:35.25,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\fs37.5\2a&HFF&\k5\pos(786,586.5)\c&HECE7E9&}M{\k4}oon {\k5}Br{\k5}ac{\k5}er
Dialogue: 2,0:05:32.16,0:05:35.25,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\fs37.5\2a&HFF&\k5\pos(786,585)\c&H535152&}M{\k4}oon {\k5}Br{\k5}ac{\k5}er
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.16,0:05:35.25,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\fs37.5\2a&HFF&\k5\pos(786,658.5)\c&HECE7E9&}Fa{\k5}ir{\k4}y {\k5}Bo{\k5}ots
Dialogue: 2,0:05:33.16,0:05:35.25,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\fs37.5\2a&HFF&\k5\pos(786,657)\c&H535152&}Fa{\k5}ir{\k4}y {\k5}Bo{\k5}ots
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.87,0:05:35.25,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\fs37.5\2a&HFF&\k5\pos(786,730.5)\c&HECE7E9&}Fl{\k5}or{\k4}id {\k5}Be{\k5}lt
Dialogue: 2,0:05:34.87,0:05:35.25,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\fs37.5\2a&HFF&\k5\pos(786,729)\c&H535152&}Fl{\k5}or{\k4}id {\k5}Be{\k5}lt
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.79,0:05:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why would you do all this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.25,0:05:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you, but only if you\Npromise not to laugh, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.47,0:05:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.57,0:05:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.77,0:05:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because you look\Nlike my little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.21,0:06:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.86,0:06:07.99,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\fs36\fscy102\pos(369,979.5)\c&HDDD9DA&}Ebon Dagger\N\N\NSilver Thread Armor\N\N\NMoon Bracer\N\N\NFairy Boots\N\N\NFlorid Belt
