Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.65,0:06:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.89,0:06:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, it works with why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.95,0:06:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be helping each other out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.63,0:06:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Silica.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.97,0:06:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll be working\Ntogether for a little while.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.09,0:06:26.21,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(961.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H030E1A&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H40\3c&H091E1C&\fscx110}35{\fscx95}th Floor • Mishe
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.09,0:06:26.21,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(961.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H030E1A&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H55\fscx110}35{\fscx95}th Floor • Mishe
Dialogue: 2,0:06:23.09,0:06:26.21,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\shad0\pos(960,942)\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&\fscx110}35{\fscx95}th Floor • Mishe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.39,0:06:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! It's Silica!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.05,0:06:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took you a long time to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.89,0:06:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were getting worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.71,0:06:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to team up with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.35,0:06:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take you wherever you want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.67,0:06:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really nice of you to offer, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.19,0:06:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've sort of already agreed\Nto be in a party with him, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.21,0:06:52.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, later, bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.53,0:06:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to put you\Non the spot like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.45,0:06:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't know you had fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.91,0:07:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.71,0:07:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.77,0:07:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't take me seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.29,0:07:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They want me to be their mascot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.41,0:07:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're right, they call me Dragon\NTamer, and I guess it went to my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.07,0:07:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.57,0:07:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll make it in time, promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you live around here, Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.71,0:07:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on floor 50; it's kind of far,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.51,0:07:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I was thinking of getting\Na room tonight if you stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.63,0:07:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take you out for some\Ncheesecake—it's really good here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.53,0:07:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here Well, if it isn't silica.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.81,0:07:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you made it out of the forest alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.51,0:07:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good for you, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.73,0:07:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.79,0:07:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, nothing. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.31,0:07:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to your\Nlittle friend the lizard?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.67,0:07:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did it run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.45,0:07:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peanut died saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.09,0:07:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm gonna get Peanut back. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.17,0:08:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you'll be heading for\Nthe Hill of Memories then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.21,0:08:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if you'll be able\Nto clear it at your level.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.87,0:08:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course she will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.73,0:08:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that difficult to level.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.61,0:08:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, God, this girl seduced another player.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.77,0:08:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's not difficult, but\Nyou don't look that strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.89,0:08:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.91,0:08:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does she have to be so mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.51,0:08:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, is Sword Art Online your first MMO?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.87,0:08:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.85,0:08:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lot of people's personalities\Nchange when they play games online.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.19,0:08:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And some actually like playing\Nthe game as the bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.73,0:08:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see how our cursors are green?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.17,0:08:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you commit a crime against another\Nplayer, your cursor's gonna turn orange.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.57,0:08:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then they become what's\Ncalled a red player.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.07,0:08:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The worst, also known as player killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.83,0:08:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all about murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.95,0:08:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They kill other players?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.71,0:08:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a normal game, they roleplay as the\Nbad guy, have some laughs, and it's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.99,0:09:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Sword Art Online isn't normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.57,0:09:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's definitely not a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.47,0:09:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.35,0:09:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.21,0:09:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I think you're good, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.51,0:09:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you saved me after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.69,0:09:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you cheered me up instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.69,0:09:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Silica.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.19,0:09:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, where the heck is\Nour cheesecake already?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.03,0:09:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.31,0:09:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our dessert hasn't shown up yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.37,0:09:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he'd laugh if I told\Nhim I wanted to talk some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.63,0:09:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silica, you still awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.43,0:09:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.73,0:09:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot to tell you some stuff about\Nfloor 47, but it can wait till tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.41,0:09:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, now's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.35,0:09:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I was just thinking\NI should ask you about…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.97,0:10:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.37,0:10:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up? Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.41,0:10:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.41,0:10:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that thing do, Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.77,0:10:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a mirage sphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.33,0:10:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.47,0:10:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the town area of 447\Nand that's the Hill of Memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.07,0:10:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was thinking if we\Ntake this route, we can
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.15,0:10:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.67,0:10:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.01,0:10:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.35,0:10:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An eavesdropper.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.71,0:10:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.83,0:10:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you can't hear through\Na door unless you knock first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.71,0:10:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if your listening skill\Nis high enough, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.57,0:10:51.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It takes practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.05,0:10:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that many players have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.57,0:10:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would they want to listen to us? Hmm?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.65,0:11:04.91,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,550)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(952.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H191919&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H40\3c&H091E1C&}February {\fscx110}24{\fscx95}th, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}      {\fscx100}47{\fscx95}th Floor • Floria
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.65,0:11:04.91,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,550)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(952.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H191919&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H80}February {\fscx110}24{\fscx95}th, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}      {\fscx100}47{\fscx95}th Floor • Floria
Dialogue: 2,0:11:00.65,0:11:04.91,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,550)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\shad0\pos(951,942)\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&}February {\fscx110}24{\fscx95}th, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}      {\fscx100}47{\fscx95}th Floor • Floria
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.69,0:11:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.81,0:11:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is like a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.23,0:11:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.14,0:11:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole floor is covered in flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.35,0:11:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why they call it the Flower Garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.07,0:11:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couples!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.33,0:11:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silica?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.63,0:11:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.54,0:11:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.57,0:11:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Nothing.\NNothing at all. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.67,0:11:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.35,0:11:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.77,0:11:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything bad happens while we're in\Nhere, I'm gonna tell you to warp out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.77,0:11:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I do, use this crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.65,0:11:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can jump to any town with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.95,0:11:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But... No buts. Use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.21,0:12:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.47,0:12:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.63,0:12:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we take this path, it'll lead\Nus right to the Hill of Memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.75,0:12:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, Kirito...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.59,0:12:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.81,0:12:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing's not that strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.79,0:12:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Jimmy, don't save me!\NBut don't look! Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.97,0:12:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't look!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.88,0:12:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll be... difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.05,0:12:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.29,0:12:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look me in the eye! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.71,0:12:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.13,0:12:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.49,0:13:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you don't mind me asking,\Nbut what's your sister like?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.13,0:13:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.63,0:13:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you said I looked like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.91,0:13:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's not polite to ask about\Nyour real life, but what's she like?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.45,0:13:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call her my little sister,\Nbut she's really my cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.57,0:13:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were raised like brother and\Nsister since we were babies,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.53,0:13:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I doubt she even knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.63,0:13:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I know, and I guess that's\Nthe reason I avoided her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.23,0:13:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our grandfather's really strict.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.97,0:13:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was eight, he made us take\Nclasses at the local kendo dojo,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.03,0:13:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but after a couple years, I stopped going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.91,0:13:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandpa beat the hell out of me\Nfor that—that's awful anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.69,0:13:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then my sister stood up for\Nme and told him to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.73,0:13:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said she'd train hard\Nfor both of us, and she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.35,0:13:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She trained hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.59,0:13:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She even made it to the nationals.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.29,0:13:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She did how awesome, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.39,0:14:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always felt guilty for\Nputting her through that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.65,0:14:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't doubt it if she hates me;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.99,0:14:04.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God knows she could have\Nbeen doing something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.05,0:14:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's why I wanted\Nto help you in a weird way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.47,0:14:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes me feel like I'm paying her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.65,0:14:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is, if you don't\Nmind me saying—you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.49,0:14:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think she hates you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.73,0:14:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She wouldn't work that hard\Nfor you if she didn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.05,0:14:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I bet she even loves kendo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.67,0:14:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you go again, making me feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.59,0:14:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me feel
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.47,0:14:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.47,0:14:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.29,0:14:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.35,0:14:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna do my best, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.15,0:14:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kiriko!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.55,0:15:02.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that reviving flower around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.25,0:15:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.13,0:15:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, pick it up.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.14,0:15:33.97,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\fs37.5\pos(906,646.5)\c&HD3D5D8&}Pneuma Flower
Dialogue: 2,0:15:33.14,0:15:33.97,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\fs37.5\pos(906,645)\c&H838587&}Pneuma Flower
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure it'll bring Pina back to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.57,0:15:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.65,0:15:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.07,0:15:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a bunch of strong\Nmonsters lurking around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.87,0:15:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's revive it when we get back to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.91,0:15:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Pina would want it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.69,0:15:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.15,0:15:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.57,0:15:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever's hiding out there, come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.45,0:16:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.99,0:16:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rosalia?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.90,0:16:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you saw through my\Nhiding skill so easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.45,0:16:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your detection skill must\Nbe really high, Swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.47,0:16:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, it looks like you were successful\Ngetting your hands on the Name Flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.05,0:16:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.83,0:16:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, hand it over before you get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.49,0:16:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.35,0:16:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's handing anything over, Rosalia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.09,0:16:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.27,0:16:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or the Orange Gill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.55,0:16:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or should I say Titan's hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.53,0:16:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're their leader, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.55,0:16:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.91,0:16:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Rosalia's cursor is green.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.81,0:16:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an easy trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.45,0:16:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The green members find their victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.91,0:16:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, they lure them straight to\Nthe orange players for the ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.89,0:16:47.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was one of your pals last night\Neavesdropping on us, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.51,0:16:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, the reason you were in that\Nparty with me and the others was to...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.29,0:16:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How perceptive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.35,0:16:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was observing their strength and watching\Nthem earn all that beautiful money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.21,0:17:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were who I was excited about, and\NI was so sad when you left the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.25,0:17:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then you told me you\Nwere getting a rare item.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.49,0:17:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I want to know is if you knew\Nabout us, why did you bring her here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.13,0:17:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you dumb or does she have\Nyou wrapped around her finger?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.73,0:17:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, you're wrong both times.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.63,0:17:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, I've been looking\Nall over for you, Rosalia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.59,0:17:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.57,0:17:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember ten days ago, you attacked\Na guild called the Silver Flags?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.69,0:17:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The leader survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.05,0:17:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ford didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.29,0:17:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the losers with no money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.79,0:17:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their leader went back and forth,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.63,0:17:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from the warp point to the\Nfront lines morning till night,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.53,0:17:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and with tears in his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.89,0:17:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he begged everyone he met\Nto avenge his dead friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.15,0:17:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he didn't want you killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.43,0:17:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he wanted you to go to prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.53,0:17:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how he felt?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.39,0:17:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't say I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.07,0:17:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only idiots take this seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.47,0:17:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what if we kill someone here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.23,0:18:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no proof dying\Nhere means you're dead IRL.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.91,0:18:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's time you started\Nworrying about yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.99,0:18:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, there's too many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.95,0:18:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.43,0:18:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.61,0:18:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be safe if you stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.57,0:18:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep the crystal handy till I say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.61,0:18:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.15,0:18:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.91,0:18:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.71,0:18:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dressed in black, one-handed, no shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.65,0:18:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, it's the Black Swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.89,0:18:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rosalia, that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.81,0:18:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the beater who plays\Nsolo on the front lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.25,0:18:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's with the assault team.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.77,0:18:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.31,0:18:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would someone from the assault\Nteam be all the way down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.95,0:18:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, take him out and take\Neverything he owns. Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.13,0:19:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to save him. He won't last.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.57,0:19:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell, you idiots?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.95,0:19:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill him already!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.09,0:19:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,410 seconds, give or take.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.49,0:19:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's about the total damage the\Nseven of you can inflict on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.93,0:19:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm level 78.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.85,0:19:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got 14,500 HP.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.95,0:19:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My battle healing skill auto-regenerates\N600 points every 10 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.23,0:19:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could stand here all day\Nand you wouldn't get anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.87,0:19:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not possible. Wanna bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.43,0:19:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If your numbers are high\Nenough, you're invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.79,0:19:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss that use leveling\Nsystems are unfair that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.41,0:19:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My client spent his entire fortune on this
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.13,0:19:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,warp crystal and he'll\Nget his money's worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.59,0:20:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been set to the\Ncoordinates of the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.79,0:20:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm sending all of you bastards there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.81,0:20:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm green, and if you\Nhurt me, you'll go orange.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.99,0:20:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a solo player, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.27,0:20:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if I have to play\Nas orange for a couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.13,0:20:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry, Silica.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.13,0:20:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whole time I was using\Nyou as bait to catch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.37,0:20:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd be scared if\NI told you the truth about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.41,0:20:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could never be scared of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.13,0:20:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you're a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.19,0:20:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, do you really have to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.23,0:20:49.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've been away from the\Nfront lines for five days.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.37,0:20:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.71,0:20:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's Koya with the assault team.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could try for a hundred\Nyears and never make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.45,0:21:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.45,0:21:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, levels are just numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.65,0:21:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a person's strength in\Nthis world is just an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.79,0:21:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, it's cool and all, but there\Nare more important things than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.77,0:21:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should meet up in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.01,0:21:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.15,0:21:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because I like having you as a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.67,0:21:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.61,0:21:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.13,0:21:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, ready to revive Pina? Yeah!
